<title>USA: Claire's Stores January same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>Claire's Stores January same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>PEMBROKE PINES, Fla. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Claire's Stores Inc said on Thursday January same-store sales rose 13 percent, for the four weeks of January this year to the corresponding four weeks in January last year.</p>
<p>Total sales rose 29 percent to $26,346,000 against $20,398,000 on the four-week basis.</p>
<p>If the four-week period is compared to the five weeks ended February 3, 1996 last year, sales rose five percent.</p>
